#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_editor/interface/panels/undo.rst:5
msgid "Undo panel"
msgstr "撤消面板"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_editor/interface/panels/undo.rst:7
msgid ""
"The Undo panel displays the history since last time that the `title block`_ "
"was saved. Once the `title block`_ is saved, undo panel is automatically "
"cleaned."
msgstr ""
"撤消面板显示自上次保存 `图框 <title block_>`_ 以来的历史。 一旦保存 `图框 <title block_>`_，撤消面板将自动清理 "
"。"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_editor/interface/panels/undo.rst:13
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech Undo panel"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech Undo 面板"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_editor/interface/panels/undo.rst:15
msgid "To display Undo panel:"
msgstr "要显示撤消面板："

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_editor/interface/panels/undo.rst:17
msgid "Select **Settings > display > Undo** menu item to display Undo panel."
msgstr "选择 **设置 > 显示 > 撤销** 菜单项以显示撤消面板。"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_editor/interface/panels/undo.rst:21
msgid ""
"For more information about utilities from Undo panel, refer to `QElectroTech"
" Undo panel`_ section."
msgstr ""
"关于Undo面板上的公用事业的更多信息，请参见 `QElectroTech Undo面板 <QElectroTech Undo panel_>`_ 节。"
